{"id":"2.6.3.5","doc":"T","title":"RTC Peripheral Interrupts","words":271,"blocks":[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":1,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"The interrupts from some sensors, software, and RTC "},{"t":"block","v":"I2C","id":"i2c"},{"t":"text","v":" can be routed to "},{"t":"block","v":"ULP-RISC-V","id":"ulp"},{"t":"text","v":"."}]},{"n":2,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"To enable the interrupts, please set the register "},{"t":"reg","v":"SENS_SAR_COCPU_INT_ENA_REG"},{"t":"text","v":", see Table 2.6-4."}]}]},{"t":"table","caption":"Table 2.6-4. ULP-RISC-V Interrupt List","head":[[{"t":"text","v":"Enable bit"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Interrupt"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Description"}]],"rows":[{"n":3,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"0"}],[{"t":"field","v":"TOUCH_DONE_INT"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Triggered when the "},{"t":"block","v":"touch sensor","id":"touch"},{"t":"text","v":" completes the scan of a channel"}]]},{"n":4,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"1"}],[{"t":"field","v":"TOUCH_INACTIVE_INT"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Triggered when the touch pad is released"}]]},{"n":5,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"2"}],[{"t":"field","v":"TOUCH_ACTIVE_INT"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Triggered when the touch pad is touched"}]]},{"n":6,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"3"}],[{"t":"field","v":"SARADC1_DONE_INT"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Triggered when "},{"t":"block","v":"SAR ADC1","id":"adc"},{"t":"text","v":" completes the conversion one time"}]]},{"n":7,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"4"}],[{"t":"field","v":"SARADC2_DONE_INT"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Triggered when SAR ADC2 completes the conversion one time"}]]},{"n":8,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"5"}],[{"t":"field","v":"TSENS_DONE_INT"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Triggered when the "},{"t":"block","v":"temperature sensor","id":"temp-sensor"},{"t":"text","v":" completes the dump of its data"}]]},{"n":9,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"6"}],[{"t":"field","v":"RISCV_START_INT"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Triggered when ULP-RISC-V powers on and starts working"}]]},{"n":10,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"7"}],[{"t":"field","v":"SW_INT"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Triggered by software"}]]},{"n":11,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"8"}],[{"t":"field","v":"SWD_INT"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Triggered by timeout of Super Watchdog (SWD)"}]]},{"n":12,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"9"}],[{"t":"field","v":"TOUCH_TIME_OUT_INT"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Triggered by touch pad sampling timeout"}]]},{"n":13,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"10"}],[{"t":"field","v":"TOUCH_APPROACH_LOOP_DONE_INT"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Triggered when touch pad completes an APPROACH sampling"}]]},{"n":14,"c":[[{"t":"text","v":"11"}],[{"t":"field","v":"TOUCH_SCAN_DONE_INT"}],[{"t":"text","v":"Triggered when touch pad completes the scan of the final channel"}]]}]},{"t":"p","s":[{"n":15,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Note:"}],"warn":true}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":16,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Besides the above-mentioned interrupts, ULP-RISC-V can also handle the interrupt from RTC_IO by simply configuring RTC_IO as input mode."}]},{"n":17,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Users can configure RTCIO_GPIO_PIN"},{"t":"i","c":[{"t":"text","v":"n"}]},{"t":"text","v":"_INT_TYPE to select the interrupt trigger modes."}]},{"n":18,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"For more details about RTC_IO configuration, see "},{"t":"xref","id":"6","c":[{"t":"text","v":"Chapter 6"}]},{"t":"text","v":" IO MUX and GPIO Matrix (GPIO, IO MUX)."}]}]}],[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":19,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"The interrupt from RTC_IO can be cleared by releasing RTC_IO and its source can be read from the register "},{"t":"reg","v":"RTCIO_RTC_GPIO_STATUS_REG"},{"t":"text","v":"."}]}]}],[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":20,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"The "},{"t":"field","v":"SW_INT"},{"t":"text","v":" interrupt is generated by configuring the register "},{"t":"field","v":"RTC_CNTL_COCPU_SW_INT_TRIGGER"},{"t":"text","v":"."}]}]}],[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":21,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"For the information about RTC I2C interrupts, please refer to "},{"t":"xref","id":"2.7.4","c":[{"t":"text","v":"Section 2.7.4"}]},{"t":"text","v":"."}]}]}]]}]}